{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51851","headline":"小桃源（曩有耕于小桃源得一铜牌，牌上有诗一绝云：） · 无名氏","name":"小桃源（曩有耕于小桃源得一铜牌，牌上有诗一绝云：）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绰约去朝真，仙源万木春。\n要知窃桃客，定是会（一作滑）稽人。\n（《舆地纪胜》一六六《长宁军》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51851.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51851","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}